3. Buildings for factories, knowledge industries, cultural industries, information and communications industries, and resource stockpiling facilities under Article 2 of the Industrial Sites and Development Act, and buildings for education, research, information processing, and distribution facilities directly related thereto;
4. Buildings installed by a managing agency under Article 30 (2) of the Industrial Cluster Development and Factory Establishment Act for the management of an industrial complex, support for enterprises located therein, and employee welfare (excluding portions used for profit-making business);
5. Buildings for supply facilities under subparagraph 6 of Article 2 of the Integrated Energy Supply Act (in the case of pipeline facilities under Article 5 (1) 4 of the Enforcement Decree of the Local Tax Act installed in new technology startup cluster areas under the Special Act on the Promotion of Venture Businesses, limited to pipeline facilities for supplying integrated energy to the relevant areas);
