(3) Middle-standing enterprises under Article 114 (1) 1 (a) of the Act shall be middle-standing enterprises under Article 10 (1) of the Enforcement Decree of the Restriction of Special Taxation Act. <Newly Inserted on August 20, 2014>

(4) "Schools prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 114 (1) 2 (a) of the Act means schools falling under any subparagraph of Article 23 (5) of the Enforcement Decree of the Restriction of Special Taxation Act. <Amended on August 20, 2014; February 3, 2015>

