(10) In applying paragraphs (5) and (6), where a domestic person has established a business, etc. in the relevant taxable year, the number specified for the relevant category in the subparagraphs of Article 23 (13) of the Enforcement Decree of the Restriction of Special Taxation Act shall be deemed the number of regular employees in the immediately preceding or relevant taxable year. <Amended on August 20, 2014; February 3, 2015>

