(12) A person seeking a tax credit pursuant to Article 114 (1) of the Act shall submit an application for a tax credit and a statement of calculation of the tax credit prescribed by Ordinance of the Ministry of the Interior and Safety to the head of the local government having jurisdiction over the place of tax payment, together with the tax base return: Provided, That, where the person applies to the tax office head having jurisdiction over the place of tax payment for an income tax credit pursuant to Article 23 (15) of the Enforcement Decree of the Restriction of Special Taxation Act, the person shall be deemed to have also applied for an individual local income tax credit under Article 114 of the Act. <Amended on August 20, 2014; November 19, 2014; February 3, 2015; July 26, 2017>

(13) Paragraphs (2) through (12) shall also apply mutatis mutandis where an investment under paragraph (1) is made in the Gaeseong Industrial Complex under subparagraph 1 of Article 2 of the Act on Support for Gaeseong Industrial Complex. <Amended on August 20, 2014>

