(1) "Amount equivalent to interest calculated as prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 117 (2) of the Act means the amount calculated by multiplying the tax credited pursuant to Article 117 (1) of the Act by the period in subparagraph 1 and the rate in subparagraph 2:

