Article 73 (Carryover Taxation of Individual Local Income Tax on Capital Gains upon Conversion into a Corporation)
(1) "Method of business transfer and acquisition prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 120 (1) of the Act means the method under Article 29 (2) of the Enforcement Decree of the Restriction of Special Taxation Act, and "consumption-oriented service business prescribed by Presidential Decree" means a business falling under any subparagraph of Article 29 (3) of the Enforcement Decree of the Restriction of Special Taxation Act.

